{"availability":"available","full":"a16z-infra/companion-app","name":"companion-app","description":"AI companions with memory: a lightweight stack to create and host your own AI companions","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":5977,"forks":952,"created":"2023-06-22T04:25:35Z","updated":"2024-04-23T06:48:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-companion-stack.com/","topics":[],"demo":"https://ai-companion-stack.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:46.259Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:46.259Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:46.259Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.078Z","stars":5980,"forks":950},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:25:02.035Z","stars":5978,"forks":951},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:33:46.259Z","stars":5977,"forks":952}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a tutorial stack to create and host AI companions that you can chat with on a browser or text via SMS. It allows you to determine the personality and backstory of your companion, and uses a vector database with similarity search to retrieve and prompt so the conversations have more depth. It also provides some conversational memory by keeping the conversation in a queue and including it in the prompt.","It currently contains companions on both ChatGPT and Vicuna hosted on Replicate.","There are many possible use cases for these companions - romantic (AI girlfriends / boyfriends), friendship, entertainment, coaching, etc. You can guide your companion towards your ideal use case with the backstory you write and the model you choose."],"features":["🚀 How does this work?","👤 Adding/modifying characters","👩‍💻 How to contribute to this repo","💽 Exporting your companion to Character.ai"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/a16z-infra/companion-app/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d99023f292eec9053ab2aefe5186fb159c8d8a3cd8a067ee194f9cc15dbaadd2","extractedAt":"2026-10-08